2026-11-12:07:09:04 macbookphi2115.win.ad.jhu.edu /Users/pkoehn/LaTex/jhu-intro-hlt.github.io/exam   764  \solution{All strings is $\Sigma^*$w or ``sigma star''. $\epsilon$ denotes the empty string. The $\Sigma$s for the three languages are the set of Latin-1 characters (ASCII isn't enough, since English words can have diacritics), the set of cyrillic characters, and the entire unicode character set. \vspace{1cm}}
