2026-11-12:07:09:07 macbookphi2115.win.ad.jhu.edu /Users/pkoehn/LaTex/jhu-intro-hlt.github.io/exam   912  %\item Component 1:\solution{LLM-based SQL Generator: Convert the question into an SQL query. Neural component which relies on the superior language understanding abilities of LLMs.}{\vspace{5cm}}
2026-11-12:07:09:07 macbookphi2115.win.ad.jhu.edu /Users/pkoehn/LaTex/jhu-intro-hlt.github.io/exam   913  %\item Component 2:\solution{SQL Database: processes the SQL query and returns the relevant data for answering the question or even the answer itself. Symbolic component that relies on the superior ability of such process to deal precisely with a large set of data items.}{\vspace{5cm}}
2026-11-12:07:09:07 macbookphi2115.win.ad.jhu.edu /Users/pkoehn/LaTex/jhu-intro-hlt.github.io/exam   914  %\item Component 3:\solution{Synthesizer: takes numerical results or selected data from the SQL database agent and formulates an answer in natural language. Neural component that relies on LLMs ability to generate fluent text and interpret informtation.}{\vspace{5cm}}
