2026-11-12:07:09:07 macbookphi2115.win.ad.jhu.edu /Users/pkoehn/LaTex/jhu-intro-hlt.github.io/exam   919  Answer the following questions with one or two sentences each, using the following figure of a RNN with Attention architecture if needed.\\[0.2cm]
2026-11-12:07:09:07 macbookphi2115.win.ad.jhu.edu /Users/pkoehn/LaTex/jhu-intro-hlt.github.io/exam   920  \vspace{-1cm}
2026-11-12:07:09:07 macbookphi2115.win.ad.jhu.edu /Users/pkoehn/LaTex/jhu-intro-hlt.github.io/exam   921  \begin{center}
